<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔσῑτ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with good appetite</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				124
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. πολλῶν σιτίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					1.16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easy to feed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.41
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>well-provided with food</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>producing a hearty appetite</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔσιτον οἱ πόνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				6.33
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 and 
				Sup.
			, Id.ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.26.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.11.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔκριθος</span>
			 (q.v.), Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.34
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
